        "Description": "Jason Portman has developed an obsession with fashion model Helmut Krüger, going to disturbing lengths to imitate his appearance. Meanwhile, hospital director Akira Nakamura is suspected of overseeing procedures that have left multiple patients resembling Krüger.\r\rThe client considers both men dangerous and demands answers. Investigate the connection and expose their alleged conspiracy.\r\rGood hunting, 47.",
